摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Search archived and unarchived chats within separate scopes, preview conversations, manage tags and notes, archive by workspace, import and export ZIP backups, explore conversation lineage, confirm permanent deletions with retry, and check for updates.","id":"gh:1335515059","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-archived-chats","slug":"Ultroncn/dsh-archived-chats","topics":["archive","backup","chat-history","conversation-search","data-recovery","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","local-first","recycle-bin","session-management"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Search archived and unarchived chats within separate scopes, preview conversations, manage tags and "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"notes, archive by workspace, import and export ZIP backups, explore conversation lineage, confirm pe"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"rmanent deletions with retry, and check for updates."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"Archive Management"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Find past DSH chats, manage archives, and keep ZIP backups.\ndsh-archived-chats"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English · 简体中文\nPlugin market · npm · Releases · Discussions · Private security report"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Archive Management adds conversation search, organization and backups to DeepSeek Harness. Find a pa"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"st solution, preview its context, archive by workspace, or save a ZIP before deleting a chat."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **Deep search:** search titles, message bodies and tool results within Archived or Unarchived, plu"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"s tags and notes in Archived; results show the matching turn in context with a direct link to jump t"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"here.\n- **Organize chats:** manage Archived and Unarchived, including workspace groups, ungrouped ch"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"ats, bulk actions, tags and notes.\n- **Portable backups:** export and import JSON + Markdown ZIPs; i"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"mports preview before writing and skip existing IDs to avoid overwrites.\n- **Conversation lineage:**"},{"id":"p6s6","text":" read-only Origins & Branches view traces sources, forks and subagent relationships across all works"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"paces, including archived and unarchived chats."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"> This document describes version 2.0.0. Previous recovery features are removed, with explicit retri"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"es for permanent-deletion tasks."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install and open"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Find `dsh-archived-chats` in the DSH plugin market, verify author **Ultronen**, and install. Follow "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"the host's restart prompt, then open **Settings → Archive Management** (Chinese: **设置 → 归档管理**)."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Alternatively, use the CLI. `web` is an example profile; replace it with your running DSH profile an"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"d use the same profile for updates and removal:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"If installation reports `ERR_PNPM_ADDING_TO_ROOT`, add `-w` after `add`. To update:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## First task"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"1. Open **Unarchived**, click a chat title to preview it, then archive the chat you want to keep. Bl"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ank new chats are excluded; running chats require explicit **Stop and archive** confirmation.\n2. Sea"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"rch **Archived**, open a title or matching snippet, and edit tags and notes from the preview.\n3. Cho"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"ose **Select**, check chats, and choose **Export selected**; narrow layouts place this action in the"},{"id":"p15s5","text":" three-dot menu. Verify the ZIP in browser downloads.\n4. **Unarchive** to continue chatting. Before "},{"id":"p15s6","text":"deleting, decide whether to keep a backup: deletion is permanent and cannot be undone."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Deletion covers the exclusive session directories and corresponding records of selected chats and th"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"eir subagent descendants. Project files, shared attachments outside session directories, and indepen"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"dent backups are retained. See deletion scope and retries."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Pages and capabilities"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Page | Purpose |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| Archived | Search, filter, preview, tags and notes, import/export, unarchive and confirmed permane"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"nt deletion. |\n| Unarchived | Workspace and ungrouped chats, scoped search, preview, archive and con"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"firmed permanent deletion. |\n| Origins & Branches | Read-only sources, forks and subagents across al"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"l workspaces and archive states. |\n| About | Automatic update checks, host and local-checkout detect"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"ion, copyable installation details, host-supported updates. |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Content search starts at two characters and scans the selected scope in batches, showing progress, m"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"atches and failures; it supports Stop and Retry. See the user guide for scope, long-log limits and d"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"; it supports Stop and Retry. See the user guide for scope, long-log limits and detailed operations."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Archived searches archived chats; Unarchived searches unarchived chats. Both support body search and"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" anchored previews. Bulk archive shares the list’s hidden-session exclusions."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Archive and delete"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"**Archive organizes; Delete permanently removes.** Archive and unarchive use official Host operation"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"s. Row deletion, selected deletion, workspace Delete all and global Delete all require confirmation."},{"id":"p23s3","text":" Workspace deletion never deletes project directories. Search and filters do not narrow workspace or"},{"id":"p23s4","text":" global bulk actions."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Backups and data boundaries"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| Format | Contents | Use |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| Conversation backup ZIP | JSON, Markdown, tags, notes and attachment references; no attachment byt"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"es or automatic descendant bundling. | Preview with Import backup, then restore; existing IDs are sk"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"tomatic descendant bundling. | Preview with Import backup, then restore; existing IDs are skipped. |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Successful exports are validated against the same format and budgets as import before the download s"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"tarts. A download-started notice does not confirm the file was saved; check browser downloads."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Upgrading from older releases"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Installing an older release can restore its earlier cleanup rules. Before downgrading, keep a full d"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"ata backup and check pending tasks and format compatibility."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Requires DeepSeek Harness `0.2.2-rc.1` or later (`>=0.2.2-rc.1`). Upgrade Harness before updating th"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"e plugin on older Hosts, or keep plugin `1.7.1`. CI runs native integration tests against the offici"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"al `0.2.2-rc.1` backend on macOS, Windows and Linux."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Archive, unarchive and inventory use official capabilities. Permanent deletion coordinates Host sess"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"ion lifecycle and storage locations rather than calling one unified public deletion API. See compati"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"storage locations rather than calling one unified public deletion API. See compatibility and limits."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Screenshots"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"View screenshots"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Screenshots use demonstration conversations in an isolated official Host."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"### 1. Archived chats by workspace"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"### 2. Read-only conversation preview"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"### 3. Content search and matching snippets"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"### 4. Unarchived conversations"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"### 5. Bulk archive confirmation"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"### 6. Origins & branches list"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"### 7. Conversation lineage graph"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"### 8. About and updates"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"## Documentation and feedback"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"User guide · Architecture · Changelog · Support · Contributing"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"Use Discussions for questions and suggestions. Bug reports should include plugin and DSH versions, m"},{"id":"p46s2","text":"inimal reproduction steps and redacted errors. Report security issues privately. If this helped you "},{"id":"p46s3","text":"find past work, consider giving the project a Star."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
